#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid ""
"%(field)s cannot be used in a filter: it is calculated on the fly and Odoo "
"cannot search it. Filter by account code or by account tag instead."
msgstr "%(field)s no se puede usar en un filtro: se calcula al vuelo y Odoo no sabe buscarlo. Filtra por código de cuenta o por etiqueta de cuenta."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid "%(field)s does not exist on analytic items, so this line would fail."
msgstr "%(field)s no existe en los apuntes analíticos, así que esta partida fallaría."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid ""
"%(field)s does not exist on analytic items: it belongs to the journal item. "
"Write %(suggestion)s instead, bearing in mind it is slower (%(cost)s)."
msgstr "%(field)s no existe en los apuntes analíticos: es del apunte contable. Escribe %(suggestion)s en su lugar, teniendo en cuenta que es más lento (%(cost)s)."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid "%(field)s does not exist on the accounting account."
msgstr "%(field)s no existe en la cuenta contable."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid "%(field)s does not exist on the analytic account."
msgstr "%(field)s no existe en la cuenta analítica."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid ""
"%(field)s is a field of the analytic item itself, so it costs nothing extra."
msgstr "%(field)s es un campo del propio apunte analítico, así que no cuesta nada añadirlo."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid "%(field)s is an indexed column of the analytic item (%(cost)s)."
msgstr "%(field)s es una columna indexada del apunte analítico (%(cost)s)."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid ""
"%(field)s is not stored as a column — the account code is kept per company —"
" so it is resolved to a list of accounts once for the whole report "
"(%(cost)s). Accounts archived later are still included."
msgstr "%(field)s no se guarda como columna —el código de cuenta se guarda por compañía—, así que se resuelve a una lista de cuentas una sola vez para todo el informe (%(cost)s). Las cuentas que se archiven después siguen incluyéndose."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid ""
"%(field)s means “the analytic account of any plan”, so every plan is "
"searched at once and no index can be used (%(cost)s against %(fast)s). "
"Prefer the column of the plan you actually mean: %(columns)s."
msgstr "%(field)s significa «la cuenta analítica de cualquier plan», así que se buscan todos los planes a la vez y no se puede usar ningún índice (%(cost)s frente a %(fast)s). Es mejor usar la columna del plan que de verdad quieres: %(columns)s."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid ""
"%(field)s reaches the journal item, a table far larger than the analytic one"
" (%(cost)s against %(fast)s). Use it only for something that exists nowhere "
"else: the journal, the partner and the product are already on the analytic "
"item itself."
msgstr "%(field)s llega hasta el apunte contable, una tabla mucho mayor que la analítica (%(cost)s frente a %(fast)s). Úsalo solo para algo que no exista en ningún otro sitio: el diario, el contacto y el producto ya están en el propio apunte analítico."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid ""
"%(field)s reads a field of the analytic account of plan “%(plan)s”. Grouping"
" accounts this way is the fastest option (%(cost)s) and beats listing their "
"ids by hand."
msgstr "%(field)s lee un campo de la cuenta analítica del plan «%(plan)s». Agrupar cuentas así es la opción más rápida (%(cost)s) y es mejor que enumerar sus ids a mano."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid ""
"%(field)s reads a real column of the accounting account, and the chart of "
"accounts is small, so it is cheap (%(cost)s)."
msgstr "%(field)s lee una columna real de la cuenta contable, y el plan de cuentas es pequeño, así que sale barato (%(cost)s)."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid ""
"%(field)s reads the analytic account of plan “%(plan)s”, not the accounting "
"account — they are different things that happen to share a field name. For "
"the accounting account write %(suggestion)s."
msgstr "%(field)s lee la cuenta analítica del plan «%(plan)s», no la cuenta contable: son cosas distintas que casualmente comparten el nombre del campo. Para la cuenta contable escribe %(suggestion)s."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid ""
"%(field)s — analytic account of plan “%(plan)s”. This is the fastest way to "
"filter (%(cost)s): it uses the index of that column."
msgstr "%(field)s — cuenta analítica del plan «%(plan)s». Es la forma más rápida de filtrar (%(cost)s): usa el índice de esa columna."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid ""
"%(subformula)s is not a valid subformula. Use sum, -sum, sum_if_pos, "
"sum_if_neg or count_rows."
msgstr "%(subformula)s no es una subfórmula válida. Usa sum, -sum, sum_if_pos, sum_if_neg o count_rows."

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_demo.py:0
msgid ""
"1. Administration + Management — through the plan's column (the fastest way)"
msgstr "1. Administración + Gerencia — por la columna del plan (lo más rápido)"

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_demo.py:0
msgid "2. The same, without listing accounts — through the sub-plan Structure"
msgstr "2. Lo mismo, sin enumerar cuentas — por el sub-plan Estructura"

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_demo.py:0
msgid "3. Marketing — a single analytic account"
msgstr "3. Marketing — una sola cuenta analítica"

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_demo.py:0
msgid "4. All the expense, by accounting account type"
msgstr "4. Todo el gasto, por tipo de cuenta contable"

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_demo.py:0
msgid "5. All the expense, by accounting account prefix %s"
msgstr "5. Todo el gasto, por prefijo de cuenta contable %s"

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_demo.py:0
msgid "6. Structure expense, unfoldable by accounting account"
msgstr "6. Gasto de Estructura, desplegable por cuenta contable"

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_demo.py:0
msgid "7. Sum of 1 + 3 — an analytic line aggregates like any other"
msgstr "7. Suma de 1 + 3 — una línea analítica se agrega como cualquier otra"

#. module: account_report_analytic_domain
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_report_analytic_domain/models/account_report_expression.py:0
msgid ""
"A subformula is required: sum, -sum, sum_if_pos, sum_if_neg or count_rows."
msgstr "Hace falta una subfórmula: sum, -sum, sum_if_pos, sum_if_neg o count_rows."

